      <tests>Affected filter (note 24.8's): 895/895 (890 + 5), before and after every seed and on the committed code after the hook's formatting. Once at the end on aea926764: full BFF unit suite, first run 15600 passed, 65 failed, 54 skipped (15719) in 36 m 48 s under heavy contention - all 65 one signature (the test HttpClient's TaskCanceledException on in-memory requests that took minutes), in 48 classes none of which this round touches; those 48 classes re-run in isolation: 561/561; a second full run on the same commit: 15665 passed, 0 failed, 54 skipped (15719). Spaarke.ArchTests 600/600; Sprk.Bff.Api.IntegrationTests 104/104; Spe.Integration.Tests 403 passed, 25 skipped, 0 failed (428). Client (npm install --legacy-peer-deps in this worktree; the two file: dependencies built): jest 10 suites 259/259 (ribbon 95, provisioningService 98), before and after prettier; ui-components tsc --noEmit 0 and npm run build 0; eslint 0 errors (the pre-existing warning); node --check OK. Server seeds (of 895): SO1 4 (the ownership row fails, the role rows do not), SC1 4, SG9 3, SG10 1, SG11 5, SP1 2. Client seeds: ribbon (of 95) C2 1, C4 1, C4b 1, C6 1, C7 1, C8 2, C9 3, C10 3, each failing exactly the case it names; wizard (of 98) CW4 3, CW5 2. Each restored from a backup, touched, hash re-checked. Ribbon scripts: parse 0 errors; Set-AccessRibbon.ps1 -SecureTransitionDeployed dry run PASSED. Publish size (Compress-Archive Optimal, PDBs included, 212 files each, no MSB3030): origin/master b4b58a361 45.65 MB (47,864,547 B); base ba3e315ce 46.06 MB (48,298,386 B); this round aea926764 46.06 MB (48,299,093 B, +707 B). At most 60 MB. No vulnerable package.</tests>
